{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57206","headline":"十四科头 迷悟不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 迷悟不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迷时以空爲色，悟即以色爲空。\n迷悟本无差别，色空究竟还同。\n愚人唤南作北，智者达无西东。\n欲觅如来妙理，常在一念之中。\n阳焰本非其水，渴鹿狂趁忩忩。\n自身虚假不实，将空更欲觅空。\n世人迷倒至甚，如犬吠雷叿叿。\n（以上皆见《景德传灯录》卷二九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}